<title>USA: WestPoint sees strong home fashion demand.</title>
<headline>WestPoint sees strong home fashion demand.</headline>
<dateline>WEST POINT, Ga. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>WestPoint Stevens Inc said Thursday it continues to enjoy very strong demand for its home fashion products and its outlook is positive for 1997 and future years.</p>
<p>The company made the comments in a statement announcing its second quarter earnings, which improved on an operating basis to income of $0.34 per share from $0.28 a year ago.</p>
<p>Including the results of discontinued operations, WestPoint Stevens Inc earned $0.37 per share, up from $0.27 a year ago.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
